WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Today we're solving equations like two x plus three equals eleven.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
An equation is like a balance scale. Both sides weigh the same.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
Remember this: whatever you do to one side, you must do to the other side too.

00:20.000 --> 00:27.000
So first we take away three from both sides. That leaves two x equals eight.

00:27.000 --> 00:34.000
Then we divide both sides by two.

00:34.000 --> 00:41.000
And we get x equals four. Let's check: two times four plus three is eleven.
